{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藝人楊卓娜（Lenna）向來保養得宜，優雅大方氣質堪稱網民心目中的古典女神。日前她啟程前往杭州出席活動，順道於當地的江南水鄉建築與庭園造景中，拍攝了一輯極具東方韻味的古風寫真。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">照片中，楊卓娜身穿一襲米白色底、帶有青灰色花卉圖案的無袖旗袍，精緻的立領與盤扣設計完美襯托其頸部線條，並將玲瓏身段展現得淋漓盡致。她當天盤起長髮，髮側綴以清秀白花，耳畔戴上翡翠耳環，手腕配有溫潤玉鐲，整體造型淡雅高貴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7c1c487f-d2c8-4370-a257-115d7d212a8c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026E1H5nGpyrJ1784689363.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7c1c487f-d2c8-4370-a257-115d7d212a8c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"943299a1-fd41-4923-ac16-56239981229e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QeASkeOWRE1784689373.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"943299a1-fd41-4923-ac16-56239981229e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">置身古色古香的樓閣與綠意庭園間，楊卓娜或手持白紙摺扇倚窗凝望、或捧淡粉鮮花低頭甜笑、或扶朱紅木欄俯瞰池塘，舉手投足間盡散發濃濃的江南溫柔氣息與古典女人味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">她留言表達對此造型及當地的喜愛：「煙雨江南，來到杭州，有回到家的感覺，那種打心底裏的喜愛和舒適感，真是沒法形容。」她又透露自己從小常被誤認為杭州人，並分享對旗袍的熱愛：「旗袍是我很喜歡的衣服，十幾歲我已經叫楊媽媽做給我穿，就是天生很喜歡那份刻在骨子裏的溫婉風雅，那種朦朧含蓄的中式美學！」大批網民紛紛留言激讚其氣質高雅，完美詮釋歲月不敗的美人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T01:18:30.284870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":449,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}